		ProjectManager.UpdateRecentlySolutions(VmSolution.Instance.SolutionPath);</pre></details></article><article id="MU-L02" class="source-confirmed"><h2>MU-L02 · LoadOldLightMoudle → 模块14000 → Lang_System下Lang_ControllerSet → 两个显示字段</h2><p>source-confirmed：原方法先查询模块ID14000，在Items中取首个Name=Lang_System，再在其Items中取首个Name=Lang_ControllerSet，写静态ControllerSet。命中时IsVisible及IsDisplayInMenu均赋模块是否非null。父节点未找到时不清已有静态ControllerSet；不把本字段当每次都重新绑定到当前方案的保证。</p><p>待追：Items可动态生成、null/反射失败、父节点缺失与方案替换后的静态引用状态仍未知；显示字段最终绑定须另核。</p><details><summary>VisionMaster.AppMainWindow.TitleMenueItemData::LoadOldLightMoudle · original-managed-cil</summary><pre>docs/architecture-recovery/menu-universe-next-cil-evidence.json:1734–1753
